  "description": "CABBEQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C294 H387 Co6 N6 O45 Y6 1-,C6 H16 N1 1+,1.35(C1 H4 O1),1.95(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Y1 (Y) has 7 O neighbors; Y2 (Y) has 7 O neighbors; Y3 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y4 (Y) has 7 O neighbors; Y5 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Y6 (Y) has 8 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co5 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co6 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 2.967-3.541 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.28-109.53°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C292H390Y6Co6N6O45 (excluding disordered solvent).",
